# Copy to .env.local. Used only by the Vite dev server to seed the login form's
# credentials so development reloads do not ask for them again; the deployed
# build is unaffected and never contains credentials.
# The community image starts _SYSTEM with the password SYS, and the Management
# Portal forces a change on first sign-in. Put the password you set there; leave
# it empty and the dev server shows the login form instead of seeding it.
VITE_IOC_USER=_SYSTEM
VITE_IOC_PASS=
